[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0010","text":"（星期六，要不要戴上次收到的那副眼镜去呢……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0020","text":"（──树里酱和凛世酱\n　会不会也戴来呢……！？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0030","text":"──怎么样？\n有时尚感吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0040","text":"哦，有有\n很适合你，那副眼镜"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0050","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0060","text":"诶嘿嘿，好耶——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0070","text":"凛世……觉得如何……\n够不够……帅气……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0080","text":"当然超级帅气哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0090","text":"啊\n──等等这轮到我夸了吗……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000200_04_0100","text":"呵呵呵……！"}]
